Z||000000||curtis||06-13-2001||10:28 PM||||My brother was driving his 88 formula down the highway at 70mph the car started to studder and then died. He had just filled the car up with gas from the racetrack. We tried the ignition module, fuel filter, drained the gas tank and used some b-12 and about a gallon of gas. Now the car turns over but won't start. Checked for spark and its there.I can here the fuel pump turn on. Any ideas would be very helpfull right now.<P>thanks||||reg||5
Z||000001||starfighter007@msn.com||06-14-2001||12:19 AM||||I would check to see if your getting any fuel presure at the shrader valve.I guess iyou have spark and your timing chain didnt jump a tooth or two,I would have to say check your fuel presure.for staters at this point. let us know .||||reg||3
Z||000002||Raydar||06-14-2001||09:03 AM||||Have you got a <I>good</I> spark? If you pull off the coil wire, lay it near the terminal and crank the engine over, it should jump a fat spark and make a loud snap. If not, the coil might be bad. <BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"||||reg||1
Z||000003||Ken Wittlief||06-14-2001||09:14 AM||||any engine error codes?<P>is the ECM still powered?<P>if the dist is spinning does that mean the cams are still spinning too? (I havent looked at the cam drive setup yet)||||reg||11
Z||000004||Carrolles||06-14-2001||12:52 PM||||The distributor is driven by the cam.  So, if the distributor is turning, then so is the cam.<P>Have you tried a bit of starting fluid to see if it will pop at all?<P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||curtis||06-14-2001||07:08 PM||||When we try to start it it is popping a little acting like it wants to start. I will try to check the coil.<P>thanks||||reg||1
Z||000006||RiceCooker||06-14-2001||07:45 PM||||Yep, sounds to me like the ol pick up coil. Happened to me while i was driving as well last year. <BR>I pulled off the road and parked right under the train overpass. I couldn't have picked a better spot to stop and share my joy with all of the other public transit commuters.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>This is my witty signature,<BR>It makes me cool||||reg||1
